-- ===========================================================================
-- SECTION: Module-level API
-- GetIconByName / IsValidTheme / GetThemes / GetTheme / SetTheme / SetUIScale /
-- GetMaxScale / GetMinScale / GetCurrentTheme / Destroy / MakeWindow.
